  "retained_scopes": "The photographed heritage plaque describes 1930s terraced houses at Lane 1754. A 2014 comparison describes 1990 district refurbishment and later alterations; a 2013 local account gives 2001 redevelopment and renumbering. The individual gate-side house is presented in its photographed 2013–2015 state. Neither the 1920 claim nor the ensemble construction date is taken as its surviving façade fabric date."
